  },
  "markup": "\u003Ch3 data-start=\u002292\u0022 data-end=\u0022134\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong data-start=\u002296\u0022 data-end=\u0022134\u0022\u003EBest Exercises To Grow Your Biceps\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp data-start=\u0022136\u0022 data-end=\u0022442\u0022\u003EIf you want bigger, fuller biceps, it\u2019s not just about endless curls \u2014 it\u2019s about targeting every part of the muscle with the right exercises. By training your biceps from different angles, you can maximize stretch, tension, and overall growth. Here are three of the best moves to build serious arm size.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp data-start=\u0022444\u0022 data-end=\u0022754\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong data-start=\u0022444\u0022 data-end=\u0022472\u0022\u003E1. Incline Dumbbell Curl\u003C/strong\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EPerformed while sitting on an inclined bench, the \u003Cstrong data-start=\u0022525\u0022 data-end=\u0022550\u0022\u003Eincline dumbbell curl\u003C/strong\u003E stretches the long head of your biceps, giving that full, peaked look. Keep your elbows behind your torso and focus on a controlled movement \u2014 feel the stretch at the bottom and the squeeze at the top.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp data-start=\u0022756\u0022 data-end=\u00221014\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong data-start=\u0022756\u0022 data-end=\u0022776\u0022\u003E2. Preacher Curl\u003C/strong\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EThe \u003Cstrong data-start=\u0022783\u0022 data-end=\u0022800\u0022\u003Epreacher curl\u003C/strong\u003E locks your arms in place, isolating your biceps and removing momentum. This strict movement helps you build strength through the full range of motion, especially in the lower half where many lifters are weakest.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp data-start=\u00221016\u0022 data-end=\u00221239\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong data-start=\u00221016\u0022 data-end=\u00221036\u0022\u003E3. Bayesian Curl\u003C/strong\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EUsing a cable set behind you, the \u003Cstrong data-start=\u00221073\u0022 data-end=\u00221090\u0022\u003EBayesian curl\u003C/strong\u003E keeps constant tension on your biceps throughout the movement. It\u2019s perfect for finishing your workout strong and achieving that deep muscle pump.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp data-start=\u00221241\u0022 data-end=\u00221420\u0022\u003EMix these exercises into your arm routine and focus on control, stretch, and full contraction. With consistent effort, your biceps will grow stronger, rounder, and more defined.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
      <Value Culture="sv"><![CDATA[{
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": [],
    "expose": [],
    "Layout": {}
  },
  "markup": "\u003Ch3 data-start=\u002292\u0022 data-end=\u0022134\u0022 data-pm-slice=\u00221 1 []\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong data-start=\u002296\u0022 data-end=\u0022134\u0022\u003EB\u00E4sta \u00D6vningarna F\u00F6r Att Bygga Biceps\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp data-start=\u0022343\u0022 data-end=\u0022652\u0022\u003EOm du vill ha st\u00F6rre och fylligare biceps handlar det inte bara om o\u00E4ndliga curls \u2014 det handlar om att tr\u00E4ffa varje del av muskeln med r\u00E4tt \u00F6vningar. Genom att tr\u00E4na biceps ur olika vinklar kan du maximera stretch, sp\u00E4nning och tillv\u00E4xt. H\u00E4r \u00E4r tre av de b\u00E4sta \u00F6vningarna f\u00F6r att bygga imponerande armstorlek.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Col data-start=\u0022654\u0022 data-end=\u00221364\u0022\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp data-start=\u0022657\u0022 data-end=\u0022921\u0022\u003EIncline Dumbbell Curl\u003Cbr\u003EUtf\u00F6rs sittande p\u00E5 en lutande b\u00E4nk och str\u00E4cker ut den l\u00E5nga bicepssenan, vilket ger den karakt\u00E4ristiska toppformen. H\u00E5ll armb\u00E5garna bakom b\u00E5len och fokusera p\u00E5 kontrollerade r\u00F6relser \u2014 k\u00E4nn stretchen i botten och sammandragningen i toppen.\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp data-start=\u0022926\u0022 data-end=\u00221154\u0022\u003EPreacher Curl\u003Cbr\u003EPreacher curl l\u00E5ser armarna i ett fast l\u00E4ge, isolerar biceps och tar bort all fart. Denna strikta r\u00F6relse hj\u00E4lper dig att bygga styrka genom hela r\u00F6relsebanan, s\u00E4rskilt i den nedre delen d\u00E4r m\u00E5nga \u00E4r som svagast.\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp data-start=\u00221159\u0022 data-end=\u00221364\u0022\u003EBayesian Curl\u003Cbr\u003EUtf\u00F6rs med en kabelmaskin placerad bakom dig. Bayesian curl ger konstant sp\u00E4nning i biceps genom hela r\u00F6relsen. Den \u00E4r perfekt som avslutande \u00F6vning f\u00F6r att maximera pump och muskelkontakt.\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\u003Cp data-start=\u00221366\u0022 data-end=\u00221553\u0022 data-is-last-node=\u0022\u0022 data-is-only-node=\u0022\u0022\u003EBlanda in dessa \u00F6vningar i ditt armprogram och fokusera p\u00E5 kontroll, stretch och full kontraktion. Med konsekvent tr\u00E4ning kommer dina biceps att bli starkare, rundare och mer definierade.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
    </pageContent>
